    "text": "The Cause moved through me without me. Tell me whether to be horrified or grateful.",
    "emotion": "raw",
    "bucket": "quest",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_romance_spark",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "Sit with me. Don't pray. Just sit.",
    "emotion": "soft",
    "bucket": "romance",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_romance_courtship",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "I want to be part of the Cause your hands are in.",
    "emotion": "tender",
    "bucket": "romance",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_romance_committed",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "The Cause calls in many voices. Yours is the one I answer.",
    "emotion": "devoted",
    "bucket": "romance",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_greet_3",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "Welcome. The chapel's stocked. Walk it twice.",
    "emotion": "warm",
    "bucket": "greet",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_greet_4",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "You came back. The Cause noted it.",
    "emotion": "soft",
    "bucket": "greet",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_ambient_4",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "The third stanza of the morning chant has a typo. I won't fix it. The Cause hears the meaning.",
    "emotion": "wry",
    "bucket": "ambient",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_ambient_5",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "I sharpen the candles. It calms me. Don't ask why I keep them sharp.",
    "emotion": "low",
    "bucket": "ambient",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_ambient_6",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "Three creeds today, all from the same hand. Coincidence is rare.",
    "emotion": "thoughtful",
    "bucket": "ambient",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_ambient_7",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "The lower-deck choir hits the harmony I missed last cycle.",
    "emotion": "warm",
    "bucket": "ambient",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_ambient_8",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "I keep a pocket bible. The Cause prefers small books.",
    "emotion": "soft",
    "bucket": "ambient",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_ambient_9",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "Faith is repetition that becomes ritual that becomes truth.",
    "emotion": "calm",
    "bucket": "ambient",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_deploy_3",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "Strap the medallion on me. I want it visible.",
    "emotion": "set",
    "bucket": "deploy",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_deploy_4",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "Whatever's at the door, the Cause is already through it.",
    "emotion": "fervent",
    "bucket": "deploy",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_deploy_5",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "Cover me. I'll cover the rest. The Cause covers what's left.",
    "emotion": "ready",
    "bucket": "deploy",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_outcome_won_2",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "Three names in the prayer tonight. All survived.",
    "emotion": "warm",
    "bucket": "outcome",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_outcome_wounded_2",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "I'll heal in the chapel. Don't bring food.",
    "emotion": "edged",
    "bucket": "outcome",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_outcome_close_call",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "I felt the Cause move me three centimetres. The bullet went where I'd been.",
    "emotion": "raw",
    "bucket": "outcome",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_outcome_routine_lost",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "We came home half. The Cause counts halves.",
    "emotion": "mourning",
    "bucket": "outcome",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_event_act_complete",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "Another act. The Cause keeps reading. We keep turning the page.",
    "emotion": "calm",
    "bucket": "event",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_event_npc_returned",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "She came back. The Cause has more practice than we thought.",
    "emotion": "thrilled",
    "bucket": "event",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_event_betrayal_warning",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "The whispers are starting. Don't listen to them yet. Ask me first.",
    "emotion": "edged",
    "bucket": "event",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_event_first_pet",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "Even a demon-bound pet falls under the Cause. Reluctantly.",
    "emotion": "wry",
    "bucket": "event",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_event_relationship_warm",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "I noticed you spent an hour with the Heretic. Good. We need that argument.",
    "emotion": "approving",
    "bucket": "event",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_event_demon_summon",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "A bound spirit is still a spirit. The Cause can speak to either.",
    "emotion": "calm",
    "bucket": "event",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_event_apprentice_died",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "The Cause holds them now. I'll inscribe their name on the wall myself.",
    "emotion": "mourning",
    "bucket": "event",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_event_war_won",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "Victory in the right hands is a sermon nobody had to write.",
    "emotion": "fervent",
    "bucket": "event",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_banter_doubter",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "Doubt is a lap on the path. Walk it. Come back when you've finished.",
    "emotion": "calm",
    "bucket": "banter",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_banter_practical",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "I'll be practical when the Cause asks me to. The Cause has not asked.",
    "emotion": "wry",
    "bucket": "banter",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_banter_celebration",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "Toast loud enough that the room above us hears. The Cause likes neighbours.",
    "emotion": "warm",
    "bucket": "banter",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_quest_2_check",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "I confronted the lower-deck preacher. He recognized the lines. He didn't recognize me.",
    "emotion": "raw",
    "bucket": "quest",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_quest_followup_a",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "He says he wrote them. He's wrong. I think the Cause wrote them through us both.",
    "emotion": "wondering",
    "bucket": "quest",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_quest_resolution_deep",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "He yielded. We pray together now. Slowly.",
    "emotion": "warm",
    "bucket": "quest",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_quest_resolution_break",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "He laughed. I left. The Cause is silent about what comes next.",
    "emotion": "raw",
    "bucket": "quest",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_romance_jealous",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "I'm not the jealous type. I'm the patient type. They're related.",
    "emotion": "edged",
    "bucket": "romance",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_romance_proposal",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "Marry me at the altar I built. Or anywhere. The altar is portable.",
    "emotion": "tender",
    "bucket": "romance",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeVoiceLines.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_dlg_past_opener_0",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "I was eleven. The first sermon I heard, I cried because the priest was bored. I thought boredom was a sin against the listener.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "past"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_dlg_past_opener_1",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "I'm still not sure I was wrong about that.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "past"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_dlg_past_z_past_warm_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "A man with no congregation read the same scripture in a back alley. Same words. Same syllables. He meant them. I followed him for a year.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "past"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_dlg_past_z_past_probe_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "About procedure, yes. About form, mostly. About the Cause — never. They were stage managers, not believers.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "past",
    "directionNotes": "About procedure, yes. About form, mostly. About the *Cause* — never. They were stage managers, not believers."
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_dlg_past_z_past_probe_z_past_probe_deeper_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "Every cycle, on Foundation Day. They were the closest the Cause could find to a witness, and it broke them. I light a candle for the first one I left.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "past"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_dlg_past_z_past_probe_z_past_probe_back_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "Maybe. The Cause can use a stage manager. It cannot use a stage manager who thinks they're the playwright.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "past"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_dlg_past_z_past_cold_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "Disappointment is the first scripture. The boredom of priests is the second. The third is private and you haven't earned it.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "past"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_dlg_calling_opener_0",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "It wants me to outlive my certainties. That's the hard part.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "calling"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_dlg_calling_opener_1",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "Most days I cope by writing the next certainty before I've fully buried the last.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "calling"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_dlg_calling_z_call_warm_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "I'll bring it to the chapel I keep on this deck. The chair on the right is for the witness. You've earned a sitting.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "calling"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_dlg_calling_z_call_probe_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "Coping mechanisms keep you steady. Certainties make you act in ways your last self wouldn't. The first time the Cause called me to write against a friend, I knew it wasn't coping.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "calling"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_dlg_calling_z_call_probe_z_call_probe_deep_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "I did. They cited me back, once, in a footnote. We never spoke again. We are still, both of us, in the Cause. That counts.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "calling"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_dlg_calling_z_call_probe_z_call_probe_step_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "Yes. The Cause is wrong sometimes. The wrongness is part of its shape. I am the witness who keeps writing it down anyway.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "calling"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_dlg_calling_z_call_cold_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "Rest is for after. Not before. You knew that when you asked.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "calling"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_dlg_mortality_opener_0",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "If I die, light a single candle and write three lines. Not five. The Cause does not want a paragraph from me.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "mortality"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_dlg_mortality_opener_1",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "I have the three lines drafted in my pocket. You can read them now if you'd like.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "mortality"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_dlg_mortality_z_mort_warm_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "I came to the Cause hungry. I leave it fed. The Cause continues without me, exactly as it should.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "mortality",
    "directionNotes": "*She unfolds the paper.* I came to the Cause hungry. I leave it fed. The Cause continues without me, exactly as it should."
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_dlg_mortality_z_mort_warm_reply_1",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "I write a fourth line in my head. It's between us.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "mortality"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_dlg_mortality_z_mort_probe_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "Of dying, no. Of the Cause learning the wrong lesson from my dying — yes. That fear keeps me on missions.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "mortality"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_dlg_mortality_z_mort_probe_z_mort_probe_deep_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "That faith without doubt is a stage manager's faith. Tell that one whenever they bury me.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "mortality"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_dlg_mortality_z_mort_probe_z_mort_probe_back_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "Don't promise. Just remember the three lines. The Cause will handle the rest.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "mortality"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_dlg_mortality_z_mort_cold_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "Then I'll bury it deeper. You'll wish you'd heard it. I will not perform it twice.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "mortality"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_dlg_us_opener_0",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "I followed three Causes before this one. The first preached. The second recruited. The third broke. You did none of those.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "us"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_dlg_us_opener_1",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "I'm here because you asked me to walk beside you and didn't tell me where we were going.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "us"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_dlg_us_z_us_warm_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "Then we'll find it together. That's the only Cause I trust now.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "us"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_dlg_us_z_us_probe_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "Then I'll walk away. I would tell you first. That's the difference between this and the others.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "us"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_dlg_us_z_us_probe_z_us_probe_deep_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "Promised. With the candle and the three lines as my witness. You'll know before the rest of the ark does.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "us"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_dlg_us_z_us_probe_z_us_probe_step_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "Then I'll tell you that, too. I owe you both warnings.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "us"
  },
  {
    "id": "zealot_female_dlg_us_z_us_cold_reply_0",
    "character": "apprentice_zealot_female",
    "text": "I won't. I followed you. The Cause is in what we do together. You can disagree with me about the noun.",
    "emotion": "dialogue",
    "bucket": "dialogue",
    "file": "shared/apprenticeDialogues.ts",
    "dialogueTopic": "us"
  }
]
